/div><button class=\"speak-word\" data-word=\"la tastiera\" type=\"button\">🔊 Listen</button></div>\n    </article><article class=\"word-card\">\n      <img src=\"../../assets/vocabolario/mouse.webp\" alt=\"A mouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div class=\"word-card-body\"><h2>il mouse</h2><div class=\"word-examples\"><strong>3 example sentences</strong><ol>\n        <li><span lang=\"it\">Muovo il cursore con il mouse.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Il mouse è accanto alla tastiera.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Clicco con il mouse.</span></li>\n      </ol></div><button class=\"speak-word\" data-word=\"il mouse\" type=\"button\">🔊 Listen</button></div>\n    </article><article class=\"word-card\">\n      <img src=\"../../assets/vocabolario/stampante.webp\" alt=\"A printer\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div class=\"word-card-body\"><h2>la stampante</h2><div class=\"word-examples\"><strong>3 example sentences</strong><ol>\n        <li><span lang=\"it\">La stampante è vicino alla scrivania.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Stampo il documento.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Nella stampante c’è un foglio.</span></li>\n      </ol></div><button class=\"speak-word\" data-word=\"la stampante\" type=\"button\">🔊 Listen</button></div>\n    </article><article class=\"word-card\">\n      <img src=\"../../assets/vocabolario/documento.webp\" alt=\"A document\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n      <div class=\"word-card-body\"><h2>il documento</h2><div class=\"word-examples\"><strong>3 example sentences</strong><ol>\n        <li><span lang=\"it\">Leggo il documento.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Il documento è sulla scrivania.</span></li><li><span lang=\"it\">Invio il documento per email.</span></li>\n      </ol></div><button class=\"speak-word\" data-word=\"il documento\" type=\"button\">🔊 Listen</button></div>\n    </article><article class=\"word-card\">\n      <img src=\"../../assets/vocabolario/quaderno.webp\" alt=\"A notebook\"