ercise-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">7</div><div class=\"translation-exercise-body\">\n      <p class=\"translation-prompt\"><span class=\"prompt-label\">Translate freely</span><strong lang=\"en\">I take notes in the notebook.</strong></p>\n      <label for=\"translation-7\">Your translation</label><textarea id=\"translation-7\" rows=\"2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"true\"></textarea>\n      <div class=\"translation-actions\"><button class=\"show-translation\" type=\"button\">Shows the proposed solution</button></div>\n      <p class=\"proposed-solution\" hidden=\"\"><span>Proposed solution:</span> <strong>Prendo appunti sul quaderno.</strong></p>\n    </div></article><article class=\"translation-exercise\" data-key=\"8\"><div class=\"exercise-number\" aria-hidden=\"true\">8</div><div class=\"translation-exercise-body\">\n      <p class=\"translation-prompt\"><span class=\"prompt-label\">Translate freely</span><strong lang=\"en\">I throw the paper in the wastebasket.</strong></p>\n      <label for=\"translation-8\">Your translation</label><textarea id=\"translation-8\" rows=\"2\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"true\"></textarea>\n      <div class=\"translation-actions\"><button class=\"show-translation\" type=\"button\">Shows the proposed solution</button></div>\n      <p class=\"proposed-solution\" hidden=\"\"><span>Proposed solution:</span> <strong>Butto la carta nel cestino.</strong></p>\n    </div></article></div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </main><section class=\"conversion-section teacher-cta-section\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"teacher-cta-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">Italiano con Martin</p><h2>Choose who to learn Italian with</h2></div><p>Two teachers, two perspectives. Choose the approach that best matches your interests.</p></div><div class=\"teacher-cta-options\"><article class=\"teacher-cta\"><img src=\"../../assets/martin-portrait.webp\" alt=\"Martin\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"asyn